{
  "tema": 9265,
  "slug": "todavia-no-preterito",
  "titulo": "Todavía no with the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Todavía no llegó.",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "In Mexico, todavía no + preterite means _not yet_: todavía no llegó = he hasn't arrived yet. Put todavía no before the verb, or no before the verb and todavía at the end.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "English uses the present perfect for _not yet_ (_he hasn't arrived yet_). Mexican Spanish usually uses **todavía no** + the **preterite**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "todavía no",
            "+",
            "preterite"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Two word orders, same meaning: **Todavía no** comí. / **No** comí **todavía**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Object pronouns go between **no** and the verb: **Todavía no le dije.**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Aún no** means the same: **Aún no** llegó."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "On its own it's a short answer: ¿Ya comiste? —**Todavía no.**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The present perfect (**todavía no he comido**) is also correct, but less common in Mexico."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **ya** = _done_; **todavía no** = _not done, but coming_."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "El camión ==todavía no llegó==.",
              "en": "The bus hasn't arrived yet."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Todavía no terminé== la tarea.",
              "en": "I haven't finished my homework yet."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Ya comiste? —No, ==todavía no==.",
              "en": "Have you eaten yet? —No, not yet."
            },
            {
              "es": "==No encontré== trabajo ==todavía==.",
              "en": "I haven't found a job yet."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los jitomates ==todavía no maduraron==.",
              "en": "The tomatoes haven't ripened yet."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Aún no me pagaron==.",
              "en": "They haven't paid me yet."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi hermano ==todavía no vio== el final de la serie.",
              "en": "My brother hasn't seen the end of the series yet."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Todavía no le dije== nada a mi jefe.",
              "en": "I haven't told my boss anything yet."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
